{"id":"56527e9b297dd705","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3ValueRow.md","title":"L3ValueRow","display":"L3ValueRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3ValueRow","parameters":["v","z4788","z4789","z4790"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3ValueRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>v</span><span>z4788</span><span>z4789</span><span>z4790</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：三值语义与有限表证书。有序参数：<code>v</code>、<code>z4788</code>、<code>z4789</code>、<code>z4790</code>。</p>\n<p>真值编码 0,1,2 对应 0,1/2,1；指定值只有 2。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3ValueRow v z4788 z4789 z4790)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists a\n  (exists b\n    (and\n      (@ Pair a b z4790)\n      (and\n        (@ FmL a)\n        (and\n          (@ L3PartialVal v)\n          (or\n            (exists z4793 (and (@ PAtom z4793 a) (@ App v z4793 b)))\n            (or\n              (and (@ PBot a) (@ Num0 b))\n              (or\n                (exists z4794\n                  (exists z4796\n                    (and\n                      (@ PNeg z4794 a)\n                      (and\n                        (exists z4798\n                          (exists z4799 (and (in z4798 z4789) (and (@ App z4788 z4798 z4799) (@ Pair z4794 z4796 z4799)))))\n                        (@ L3Neg z4796 b)))))\n                (exists z4794\n                  (exists z4795\n                    (exists z4796\n                      (exists z4797\n                        (and\n                          (@ PImp z4794 z4795 a)\n                          (and\n                            (exists z4800\n                            (exists z4801 (and (in z4800 z4789) (and (@ App z4788 z4800 z4801) (@ Pair z4794 z4796 z4801)))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4802\n                            (exists z4803 (and (in z4802 z4789) (and (@ App z4788 z4802 z4803) (@ Pair z4795 z4797 z4803)))))\n                            (@ L3Imp z4796 z4797 b))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2599832c1bfb4f3c\" href=\"?note=2599832c1bfb4f3c\" title=\"ZFC_FmL\">FmL</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0d30adc92d51179\" href=\"?note=e0d30adc92d51179\" title=\"ZFC_L3Imp\">L3Imp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"45346a8e861cbc4a\" href=\"?note=45346a8e861cbc4a\" title=\"ZFC_L3Neg\">L3Neg</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e662d8dd61767d1d\" href=\"?note=e662d8dd61767d1d\" title=\"ZFC_L3PartialVal\">L3PartialVal</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ L3ValueRow v z4788 z4789 z4790)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmL|FmL]]；[[ZFC_L3Imp|L3Imp]]；[[ZFC_L3Neg|L3Neg]]；[[ZFC_L3PartialVal|L3PartialVal]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmL","status":"resolved","id":"2599832c1bfb4f3c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmL|FmL]]；[[ZFC_L3Imp|L3Imp]]；[[ZFC_L3Neg|L3Neg]]；[[ZFC_L3PartialVal|L3PartialVal]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_L3Imp","status":"resolved","id":"e0d30adc92d51179","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmL|FmL]]；[[ZFC_L3Imp|L3Imp]]；[[ZFC_L3Neg|L3Neg]]；[[ZFC_L3PartialVal|L3PartialVal]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_L3Neg","status":"resolved","id":"45346a8e861cbc4a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmL|FmL]]；[[ZFC_L3Imp|L3Imp]]；[[ZFC_L3Neg|L3Neg]]；[[ZFC_L3Part